1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,738
Reaching for a bag of chips at your desk again?

2
00:00:02,058 --> 00:00:04,538
That everyday habit might be part of why you're still backed up.

3
00:00:04,858 --> 00:00:10,668
About 1 in 5 US adults deals with chronic constipation, and diet is one of the biggest everyday factors behind it.

4
00:00:10,988 --> 00:00:14,696
Chips and other processed snacks are stripped of fiber and loaded with sodium.

5
00:00:15,016 --> 00:00:16,985
Cheese's casein digests slowly.

6
00:00:17,305 --> 00:00:19,881
And skipping water makes stool even harder to pass.

7
00:00:20,201 --> 00:00:28,066
Swap chips for popcorn or roasted chickpeas, ease up on dairy, and try 2 to 3 kiwis a day - it can work as well as fiber supplements.
